                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I ordered the chicken leg and mackerel combo set meal for 240 yuan. The fried chicken leg was surprisingly tender and juicy, and it tasted amazing because it was marinated. Most importantly, it wasn\u0027t greasy at all.\n\nThe grilled fish was a large piece, and the fish was grilled very tender. Overall, the meal was up to standard. Miso soup, sweet soup, and green tea were also available for self-service.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "點了雞腿 鯖魚雙拼套餐，價格240元\n炸雞腿居然軟嫩多汁，而且雞腿醃過的感覺，味道超棒的，重點是不油膩。\n烤魚好大一片，且魚肉烤的很嫩，整體而言餐點符合水準。另外有味噌湯、甜湯、綠茶可自行取用。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
