                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJIyr_STurQjQRi6sJZDMGsYw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGS1Uyc3diVTR0VjBGSGRFdzJTWEpmTW5WRE1XYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "6 months ago",
                        "rating":  1,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "They are severely understaffed, yet they keep letting new customers in. From ordering to receiving your food, it takes at least 40 minutes (I\u0027m not exaggerating; I even timed it). I strongly advise anyone with only an hour for lunch to absolutely avoid this restaurant. You\u0027ll only drive yourself crazy and waste a precious lunch break. Furthermore, the environment is filthy. Leftover food containers and utensils from the previous customer are piled up on every table and haven\u0027t been cleared away. Dirty plates are scattered everywhere. If you don\u0027t improve this situation within a specified timeframe, we will report it to the relevant authorities, including the Health Bureau and the Environmental Protection Bureau, for inspection.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "人手嚴重不足，還一直讓新顧客進來，點餐到上菜起碼要超過40分鐘（真心沒有誇大，我還特別算過時間），奉勸中午只有1小時出來用餐的同仁，絕對不要來這家店，不然你只會氣死自己，活生生浪費一個寶貴的午休\n然後環境髒亂，上一位吃完的餐盒餐具，堆在店裡每張桌子都沒收，髒的餐盤裡裡外外到處都是。你們再不限期改善，將會向相關單位，及衛生局、環保局來做檢舉稽查。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
